# Production build env for `next build` (Cloudflare Workers Builds).
# Committed on purpose: a Turnstile SITE key is public (it ships in browser JS).
# The matching SECRET is never here — it lives only as the TURNSTILE_SECRET Worker secret.
# Replace this with the site key created for qodlabs.in via Cloudflare Dashboard -> Turnstile.
NEXT_PUBLIC_TURNSTILE_SITE_KEY=0x4AAAAAAD9fa79LAS0zTGjl
